<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\[</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">d(</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\gamma</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\gamma</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">_{\text{target}}) &lt; </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\epsilon</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> \quad </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\Rightarrow</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> \quad \text{score} = e^{-d^</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">2</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> / </span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">2</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\sigma</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">^</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">2</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">}.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\]</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">This is **predictive coding**: the brain minimizes free energy.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\section</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{Conclusion}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\textbf</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214); font-weight: bold;">Standard Galactic Suite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">} is a formal system wherein:</span></span>
