<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Category theory shifts focus from </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">what objects are</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">} to </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">how they relate</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}. This perspective is essential for software systems:</span></span>
