<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Output:</strong> <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300">polyglot_sheaf_monumental.pdf</span> â€” <strong class="font-semibold">80--120 pages</strong> of pure, unadulterated mathematical ecstasy.</p>
